Network Level1 Fixed Color Fill =
// Per-category fill color override for network Level 1 nodes.
// Copy this measure for Level 2 and Level 3 with unique names:
//   "Network Level2 Fixed Color Fill" referencing MappedParameterTwo
//   "Network Level3 Fixed Color Fill" referencing MappedParameterThree
// Bind the resulting measure to the Level1ColorOverrideFill field in Deneb.
// When BLANK(), the spec falls back to level1DefaultFillColor (#2D3B68).
VAR _Category = MAX ( 'MappedParameter'[Category] )
RETURN
    SWITCH (
        _Category,
        "PLACEHOLDER_VALUE_1", "#01B8AA",
        "PLACEHOLDER_VALUE_2", "#FD625E",
        "PLACEHOLDER_VALUE_3", "#F2C80F",
        BLANK ()
    )
